---

<Layout
  title="Toile Blanche Experiences | Suites & Restaurant | Toile Blanche"
  description=""
  ogImage="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f3e121a6b4b79c6c69e0bb7/5f7b2972ccfa8e50ee0e8e42_HotelTemplate_OpenGraph.png"
>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 300px" src="/assets/images/page-img-fed8bab60f310c.webp"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Experiences</div><h1 class="light">ENRICHING LOCAL EXPERIENCES FOR A MEMORABLE STAY</h1><div class="hero-paragraph"><p class="light">Unwind and pamper your body through a variety of treatments, meet like-minded people on a boat, inspire your creativity with art exhibitions, and touch your senses with music</p></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing"><h2>An unforgettable experience<br/>lasts forever</h2></div><div><div class="split-section-wrapper reverse-wrap"><div class="split-section padding-top"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 2667px) 100vw, 2667px" src="/assets/images/page-img-1bc07c2749c20d.avif"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><h3>Relaxing treatments</h3><p class="feature-paragraph">Pamper your body and mind with a massage</p><p class="paragraph-13">Amandine will restore your energy levels with her massages, allowing you to forget everything around you completely.</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="https://toileblanche.bowo.app/pages/2826" target="_blank">View Wellness Menu</a></div></div></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-l-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 3266px) 100vw, 3266px" src="/assets/images/page-img-63eececa2d86be.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><h3>Leroy Brothers studio visit</h3><p class="feature-paragraph">Come and say us hello!</p><p>Visit the leroy Brothers art studio in presence of the artist.</p></div></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 1414px) 100vw, 1414px" src="/assets/images/page-img-7f21ae1bc9a088.png"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><h3>Toile Blanche Art Route</h3><p class="feature-paragraph">Follow the route for an inspiring time</p><p>10 art places to visit</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="https://www.canva.com/design/DAGh41XVur0/SkdE6UHqFwKSUe5ud1AIKg/view" target="_blank">Discover Now</a></div></div></div></div><div class="split-section"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding"><p class="feature-paragraph">From the most relaxed spirits, to those who want a more cultural offering–we help you experience what we love the most about this part of France. </p></div><div class="divider _288px mobile-l-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 3266px) 100vw, 3266px" src="/assets/images/page-img-5a95d37e2cdbac.avif"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><h3>Bike rental</h3><p><em>Discover the area with one of our 2 Moustache electric bikes. <br/></em></p></div></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-l-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 1170px) 100vw, 1170px" src="/assets/images/page-img-9539260525abcd.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><h3>Swimming Pools at Toile Blanche</h3><p class="feature-paragraph">Our two swimming pools are just a short stroll away from each suite.</p><p class="paragraph-14">The place to sip on something refreshing, while getting lost in a book, working up a deep Riviera tan, or sparking poolside conversations.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper experiences"></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2 class="heading-23">Our Suites</h2></div></div><div class="rooms-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="room-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/suiteaartiste.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e1708f1e9761a9.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de l'Artiste</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/penard.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-eb795e7700a147.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pénard</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/masartiste.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6106adc613aeb2.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Mas de l'Artiste</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/bronzette.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8626fb58027da5.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de la Bronzette</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/suite-petanque.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-833a78c568fe35.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pétanque</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/penequet.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f8a45f5b552ed.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Villa du Pénéquet</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/suite-cabanat.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-826f21859fa23e.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Cabanat</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/bonvivant.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-707417a43d47ee.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite du Bon-Vivant</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div></div></div></div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
